From: Jay Kubo <6161465+jkubo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:47:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add sessions rename and hook title delivery

Replay the fork session rename and hook title delta onto current upstream. Preserve manual pin and reset, latest observed title, terminal sequence validation, veto and continuation, blocked telemetry, and title-only stop behavior. Keep upstream result fields and the required test import. Fork tooling is excluded from this product commit.
